@startuml M6-Document-State-Machine


!define BGCOLOR #F5F5F5
skinparam backgroundColor BGCOLOR
skinparam stateBorderColor #333
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam arrowColor #333
skinparam startBorderColor #333
skinparam endBorderColor #333
skinparam endBackgroundColor #FF9999
skinparam shadowing false

title M6 Document State Machine - Actual Implementation

[*] --> SEED : Repository in\nseed file

SEED --> QUEUED_CRAWL : Add to frontier
QUEUED_CRAWL --> CRAWLING : fetchRepoData()
note on link
  GitHub API
  with retry backoff
end note

CRAWLING --> CRAWL_FAILED : Error:\nAPI failure
CRAWL_FAILED --> QUEUED_CRAWL : Retry
CRAWL_FAILED --> CRAWL_SKIPPED : Max retries exceeded
CRAWL_SKIPPED --> [*]

CRAWLING --> CRAWL_SUCCESS : README\ndownloaded

CRAWL_SUCCESS --> METADATA_STORED : Store in KV:\nowner, repo, url,\ndescription, language,\nstars, topics, readme
note on link
  Distributed store
  document metadata
end note

METADATA_STORED --> INDEX_PENDING : Ready for\nindexing

INDEX_PENDING --> INDEX_JOB : MapReduce\nterm extraction

INDEX_JOB --> MAP_PHASE : Map: tokenize\ntext, count\nterm frequencies
note on link
  lowercase, split,\nfilter tokens >2 chars
end note

MAP_PHASE --> REDUCE_PHASE : Reduce: aggregate\npostings per term
note on link
  postings[docId] = freq
  documentFrequency = count
end note

REDUCE_PHASE --> INDEX_BUILT : Inverted index\nbuilt and stored
note on link
  inv:full-index
  term -> {postings, DF}
end note

INDEX_BUILT --> INDEX_STATS : Index statistics\nstored
note on link
  docsIndexed, uniqueTerms
end note

INDEX_STATS --> INDEXED : Document\nfully indexed

INDEXED --> QUERYABLE : Ready for\nsearch queries

QUERYABLE --> QUERY_EXEC : User searches\nfor term
note on link
  queryProcessor
end note

QUERY_EXEC --> TERM_LOOKUP : Look up term\nin inverted index
TERM_LOOKUP --> NO_MATCH : Term not found
NO_MATCH --> QUERYABLE : 0 results
NO_MATCH --> [*]

TERM_LOOKUP --> MATCH : Term found\nin postings
MATCH --> SCORE_CALC : For each matched doc:\nTF-IDF calculation
note on link
  tf * log(totalDocs/df)
end note

SCORE_CALC --> BOOST_CALC : Apply metadata\nboosts
note on link
  language: 1.3x
  stars>1000: 2.0x
  stars>100: 1.5x
  stars>10: 1.2x
end note

BOOST_CALC --> FINAL_SCORE : Final score =\nTF-IDF * boost
note on link
  multiplicative\ncombination
end note

FINAL_SCORE --> SORT_RESULTS : Sort by\nfinal score

SORT_RESULTS --> FORMAT_RESULTS : Extract snippets\ngenerate excerpts

FORMAT_RESULTS --> DISPLAY : Return results\nto user

note right of CRAWL_SUCCESS
  Document acquired
end note

note right of INDEX_JOB
  MapReduce framework
  executed on cluster
end note

note right of INDEXED
  Document ready for queries
  index stored in KV
end note

note right of FINAL_SCORE
  Multiplicative scoring:
  (freq * log(N/df)) * boost
end note

@enduml
